if he's the same person.. Gojo asks if Geto feels&nbsp;
like killing all of the non-sorcerers around them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:03.120 --> 00:29:06.720
because right now in his current state of&nbsp;
mind he doesn't think he'd feel anything.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:06.720 --> 00:29:11.120
Suguru replies that it is pointless since&nbsp;
the ones in charge had fled, BUT now that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:11.120 --> 00:29:15.120
the sorcerers are still involved the time&nbsp;
vessel association can't talk themselves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:15.120 --> 00:29:18.800
out of the situation anymore. As a&nbsp;
group with problems to begin with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:18.800 --> 00:29:24.000
the star religious group will disband over time.&nbsp;
Gojo questions if there even needs to be a reason&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:24.000 --> 00:29:28.480
but Suguru assures him that there&nbsp;
does, especially for Jujutsu sorcerers.

00:29:29.120 --> 00:29:34.480
One year later in august 2007 Gojo&nbsp;
demonstrates to Suguru and Shoko&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:34.480 --> 00:29:39.680
his ability to automatically activate and&nbsp;
utilize the infinity he now possesses. An&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:39.680 --> 00:29:45.200
automatic targeting option for Jujutsu that&nbsp;
can distinguish between mass, speed, shape&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:45.200 --> 00:29:50.960
and the intensity of fused energy all in order&nbsp;
to arrange the danger of any approaching object.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:50.960 --> 00:29:55.280
Now Gojo can almost always have the&nbsp;
limitless active with minimal resources,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:55.280 --> 00:30:00.000
normally doing so would fry his brain but using&nbsp;
a reverse curse technique at the same time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:05.200
keeps him fresh. As Gojo tells them about his&nbsp;
other improvements Geto can't help but notice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:05.200 --> 00:30:10.800
that Gojo alone became the strongest. Now&nbsp;
that he can handle any mission on his own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:10.800 --> 00:30:16.640
Geto will be going on no more assignments. As well&nbsp;
with the last year's frequent disasters curses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:16.640 --> 00:30:22.240
spawning all over japan made it a busy summer&nbsp;
for the sorcerers. The endless cycle of exorcism&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:22.240 --> 00:30:27.280
consumption, constantly using his cursed spirit&nbsp;
manipulation was beginning to weigh on Geto, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:27.280 --> 00:30:31.600
began to lose his way due to the hideous evil of&nbsp;
humanity. Initially and as we all saw, he wanted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:31.600 --> 00:30:35.600
to follow through with his duty as a sorcerer&nbsp;
but he couldn't help but think of all of those&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:35.600 --> 00:30:38.328
followers of the star as monkeys... (Which as I&nbsp;
hinted at before is a complete change from who he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:38.328 --> 00:30:39.680
once was, like what happened and why. Who caused&nbsp;
him to go insane...) Anyways after our boy takes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:39.680 --> 00:30:45.840
a shower he waits around in a room alone to think&nbsp;
until Yu Haibara comes to give him some company.

00:30:45.840 --> 00:30:50.960
He tells him about his far away mission on the&nbsp;
next day and they discuss souvenirs until Suguru&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:50.960 --> 00:30:56.400
asks Haibara if he's okay with being a sorcerer?&nbsp;
Haibara replies that he's not the type to think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:56.400 --> 00:31:00.800
about tough questions, but giving his all&nbsp;
towards something he can help with provides a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:00.800 --> 00:31:06.880
great feeling for him. Suguru agrees and suddenly&nbsp;
they're both confronted by a woman asking them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:06.880 --> 00:31:11.840
‘what kind of girls they are into’. The woman&nbsp;
walks into the room with Suguru and Haibara,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:11.840 --> 00:31:17.040
Suguru questions her identity to which Haibara&nbsp;
answers and claims that he can tell she's not a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:17.040 --> 00:31:22.800
bad person. He then leaves Suguru and the woman&nbsp;
alone and shortly after she introduces herself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:22.800 --> 00:31:28.640
as the special grade sorcerer Yuki Tsukumo. Suguru&nbsp;
learned about her as the special grade who doesn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:28.640 --> 00:31:34.400
take on missions and bums around overseas.&nbsp;
Yuki explains that Jujutsu ends up treating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:34.400 --> 00:31:38.480
the symptoms of curses while she actually&nbsp;
wants to get to the root cause of it all...

00:31:38.480 --> 00:31:41.520
Suguru is confused by what she&nbsp;
means by the ‘root of it all’,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:41.520 --> 00:31:47.520
so she explains that she desires a world where&nbsp;
curses do not exist. She asks him what are curses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:47.520 --> 00:31:53.040
and Suguru is able to explain that curses are&nbsp;
born from negative energy that leaks from humans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:53.040 --> 00:31:58.160
and since this is the case there are only two&nbsp;
ways to create a world where curses don't exist.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:58.160 --> 00:32:03.680
They must either eradicate cursed energy from all&nbsp;
humans entirely, or teach humans to control it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:03.680 --> 00:32:08.080
Toji was actually a model case for the former&nbsp;
as he was the only person Yuki had found&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:08.080 --> 00:32:13.280
all over the entire world that possessed no cursed&nbsp;
energy at all. His heavenly restriction granted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:13.280 --> 00:32:18.640
him enhanced senses as well as the ability&nbsp;
to resist curses, he truly was a superhuman.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:18.640 --> 00:32:23.520
Yuki tells Suguru that there's no shame in&nbsp;
losing to someone as powerful as he was.

00:32:23.520 --> 00:32:26.720
Yuki had wanted to research him,&nbsp;
but every time he refused her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:26.720 --> 00:32:31.920
Cases of heavenly restriction are so scarce,&nbsp;
so Yuki decided to focus on the latter option&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:31.920 --> 00:32:37.120
for eradicating curses. This is because of the&nbsp;
fact that, other than cases where sorcerers die&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:37.120 --> 00:32:43.040
and become curses, sorcerers cannot give rise to&nbsp;
curses. Curse energy does not leak from sorcerers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:43.040 --> 00:32:48.800
at nearly the same rate and flow as non-sorcerers,&nbsp;
this is due to the difference in the amount of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:48.800 --> 00:32:53.840
cursed energy some sorcerers use and how it flows&nbsp;
while being contained within their bodies. In a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:53.840 --> 00:32:59.200
general sense if every human became a sorcerer&nbsp;
it would be impossible for curses to exist..

00:32:59.200 --> 00:33:03.840
Shocked and still haunted by the followers of&nbsp;
the star, Suguru asks Yuki why they shouldn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:03.840 --> 00:33:08.160
just kill every non-sorcerer... Yet he&nbsp;
snaps out of it right after that thought,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:08.160 --> 00:33:13.600
still Yuki gives him a serious reply. Wiping out&nbsp;
every non-sorcerer to force evolution might be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:13.600 --> 00:33:20.000
the easiest route but it's also the craziest..&nbsp;
She asks Suguru if he hates non-sorcerers and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:20.000 --> 00:33:24.320
he's unable to give her an answer. He knows&nbsp;
he used to believe that sorceress existed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:24.320 --> 00:33:29.360
to protect non-sorcerers but now he doesn't&nbsp;
even know if humanity is worth fighting for.

00:33:29.360 --> 00:33:33.600
Yuki confirms that Suguru must choose&nbsp;
between looking down on non-sorcerers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:33.600 --> 00:33:38.320
